      "text": "It’s Tuesday—pause the chaos and give yourself the reset you deserve. ♾️✨\n\nIn the middle of deadlines, traffic, and nonstop routines, there’s a place where everything slows down. Warm steam. Deep relaxation. Quiet moments made just for you. 💆‍♂️\n\nVisit your nearest Infinity Spa branch today:\n📍 Quezon City (E. Rodriguez) – 0967 221 8188\n📍 Fairview – 0915 028 2818\n📍 Bay Area (Parañaque) – 0995 018 7888\n📍 South Point – 0966 968 6888\n📍 Cebu – 0966 968 7888\n📍 Pampanga – 0967 063 2888\n📍 Makati – 0966 795 0888\n📍 Cubao – 0956 438 8886\n📍 Davao – 0927 568 3888\n📍 Cagayan de Oro – 0956 278 8828\n\nEscape the noise. Sink into calm. Experience the Mancave. 😌♾️\n\n#InfinitySpa #Mancavers #TuesdayReset #MomentOfStillness #MensWellness #RelaxRechargeRepeat",
